title: Media
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: media_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; media_timer += 2;
card-image: img/cumhuriyet4.jpg
#subtitle: Setting the direction for our newspapers and media outlets.

= Media

[? if I_in_government: The media is heavily restricted under the military-appointed governments. ?]

[? if I_in_government == 0: The <span style="color: #E3000F;">**CHP**</span> maintains affiliations with numerous progressive newspaper outlets. We may leverage these connections to advance our strategic objectives. ?]

- @critique
- @silence
- @commercial
- @campaign
- @ideological
- @newideas
- @return: At present, we should refrain from taking any action regarding media operations
- @navigation_return_main: Return
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@silence
title: National Chief İnönü prefers to avoid direct confrontation with the junta. Accordingly, maintaining our silence may be advisable.
view-if: CHP_party_leader == "İnönü"
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} workers_chp -= 2; petty_bourgeoisie_chp -= 2; rural_chp -= 1; left_kemalists_dissent += 5; coup_timer -= 1

We remain silent in the face of atrocities and injustice. The nation is overwhelmingly opposed to the coup, and Ecevit offers a strong critique of the party's stance; his arguments warrant serious consideration.

@critique
title: The military government needs to go. Defy the laws and protest against the recent actions of the Junta.
view-if: CHP_party_leader == "Ecevit"
choose-if: I_in_government == 1
unavailable-subtitle: The army has withdrawn their hands from the fragile democracy, for now...
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} workers_chp += 2; petty_bourgeoisie_chp += 2; kemalist_marxists_dissent -= 5; coup_timer += 1; critique += 1

We direct our media attention to the authoritarian actions of the junta governments, such as the banning of worker strikes and the torture of left-wing intellectuals in prisons. We will not bow to the whims of the appointed.

@commercial
title: We should commercialize our newspapers by expanding their appeal to audiences beyond existing party supporters.
choose-if: CHP_party_leader == "Ecevit" and I_in_government == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if I_in_government == 1: The memorandum government has restricted our political media campaigns. ?][? if CHP_party_leader != "Ecevit": Our media outlets currently face paralysis due to the ongoing intra-party crisis. ?]
subtitle: This might upset the hardliners, but it may bring in more funds.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} resources += 1; commercialized_media += 1; petty_bourgeoisie_chp += 3*(1 - dissent)

Our commercialized newspapers are able to bring in more funds. However, this will limit our ability to influence the media.

@campaign
title: The primary objective of our media operations is to enhance our prospects in upcoming elections.
choose-if: CHP_party_leader == "Ecevit" and I_in_government == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if I_in_government == 1: The memorandum government has restricted our political media campaigns. ?][? if CHP_party_leader != "Ecevit": Our media outlets currently face paralysis due to the ongoing intra-party crisis. ?]
subtitle: Our newspapers will focus on the electoral campaign.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} campaign_media += 1; workers_chp += 2*(1 - dissent); petty_bourgeoisie_chp += 2*(1 - dissent); state_employees_chp += 2*(1 - dissent)

The outlets print out news about the problems the nation faces and how a left-wing government could be the solution our people have been waiting for so long.

@newideas
title: We will motivate our theorists and politicians to write about this.
subtitle: A party without a vision is not a party but a gathering
choose-if: CHP_party_leader == "Ecevit" and I_in_government == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if I_in_government == 1: The memorandum government has restricted our political media campaigns. ?][? if CHP_party_leader != "Ecevit": Our media outlets are currently paralyzed by the intra-party crisis. The old guard resists the dissemination of unorthodox ideas. ?]
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} {! AnatolianRules.adjustFactionStrength(Q, 'km', 5); !}  workers_chp += 1; newideas += 1

We are happy to hear new voices raising their visions for a new Turkey.

@ideological
title: We intend to foster vibrant ideological debate within our newspapers.
subtitle: There will be space for all factions to air their views.
choose-if: CHP_party_leader == "Ecevit" and I_in_government == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if I_in_government == 1: The memorandum government has restricted our political media campaigns. ?][? if CHP_party_leader != "Ecevit": Our media outlets are currently paralyzed by the intra-party crisis. The old guard opposes alternative interpretations of Atatürk's path. ?]
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} kemalist_marxists_dissent -= 6; left_kemalists_dissent -= 6; orthodox_kemalists_dissent -= 6; right_kemalists_dissent -= 6;

This has been our media course historically, and it has successfully paved over the many tensions in our party.

@return
choose-if: CHP_party_leader == "Ecevit"
unavailable-subtitle: Remaining inactive in response to atrocities constitutes tacit silence.
@navigation_return_main
title: Return
view-if: {! return Q.CHP_party_leader !== "Ecevit" && !((Q.difficulty <= 0 && Q.last_advisor_action == 0 && Q.last_cabinet_action == 0) || Q.last_advisor_action == 1 || Q.last_cabinet_action == 1); !}
go-to: main

